{"event":"changes_requested","job_id":"docs-payment-methods-payto-web-drop-in","reason":"Full 625-line pinned raw and SHA-256 checked. Accepted receipt, candidate and suggestions match; five grounding quotes are exact. The candidate preserves the main Sessions/Advanced split, v70+ prerequisite, agreement versus payment finality, stored-method conditions, webhook outcomes, and the import/token/link sample cautions. One material example/table discrepancy remains unstated: the Sessions subscription table marks storePaymentMethod=true required (raw line 130), while its sample request omits the field (raw lines 162\u2013193). The source currently warns about malformed commas but does not tell readers that this example also lacks a required subscription parameter. This is a bounded correction with no broad rereview needed if the other claims stay unchanged."}
